WEBVTT

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:13.070
What a pleasant morning.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:18.450
<i>I guess this is all thanks to the 
shikigami army the president gave me.</i>

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:21.160
I'm grateful, so grateful!

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.620
And now, we have a few words 
for you from each committee

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.790
regarding the Harvest Festa 
which begins next month.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.690
Th-This is a notice from the 
Spread the Green Committee.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:34.430
Leading up to the Harvest Festa, um...

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:40.430
W-We are recrewling helpers to place 
potted herbs around the city!

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:42.810
Uh, what is "recrewling" supposed to mean?

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:46.810
Er, um, this is volunteer work,
so it doesn't pay!

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:51.020
Yosshi!

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:52.940
The Harvest Festa's gonna be a ball!

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:55.020
Don't talk to me.

00:00:55.020 --> 00:01:00.310
It's the biggest, week-long event 
in Kazamatsuri, Yosshiino!

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:02.300
School's out for the duration!

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:02.950
I know!

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:05.470
Wanna go around with me, Yoshiino?

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:07.950
At least pick one stupid nickname
and stick with it!

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:09.600
Lame.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:13.460
A wolf would only waste away at 
a banquet set for herbivores.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:15.800
He shot me down.

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:16.970
Still,

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:20.760
this year's Harvest Festa is 
shaping up to be lots of fun!

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:59.320
Episode 3: "Welcome, Supernatural Phenomena"

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:59.050
Better check the blog before class!

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:00.470
Good morning.

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:06.160
Y-Yeah, morning.

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:07.810
Now get out.

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:08.540
Oh, right.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:09.650
I'll take my leave...

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:10.560
Wait, why?!

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:12.020
Who the heck are you?!

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:13.540
Oh, how unusual.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.980
There are two boys here.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:17.260
Hello, my fair lady.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:18.550
How do you do?

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:21.320
I apologize for barging in unannounced.

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:25.300
What're you chilling for?
Why weren't you at the morning assembly?

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:28.180
I just pulled an all-nighter
on the battlefield.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.560
So, what's with the uniform?

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:35.560
Oh, it seems Chihaya-san entered my profile
on the order form for some reason.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.800
She is still wearing her 
old uniform as a result.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.000
I see.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.590
So that's the story behind it.

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:42.660
By the way, who is he?

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:44.660
Oh, this man is Chihaya's—

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:45.820
Excuse me!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:47.580
Ohtori?

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:48.770
Huh?

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:51.210
Why are you here, Sakuya?

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:55.830
Well, you forgot something important,
so I came to deliver it to you.

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:57.190
Ah, my lunch box!

00:03:57.190 --> 00:03:58.840
I forgot it?

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:01.340
Yay, thank you so much!

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.070
Hey, you.

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:03.720
Yes?

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:05.720
Who might you be?

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:09.640
My name is Tennouji Kotarou.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:10.660
It's a pleasure.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:12.250
I am Ohtori Sakuya.

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:13.630
So you're Ohtori's...

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:14.400
Big brother.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:17.790
No, Sakuya is Sakuya.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:21.360
You forgot the cover story, didn't you?

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.460
O-Oh, right...

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:28.730
Chihaya-san is a person of integrity.
She cannot tell a lie.

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:30.160
Who <i>is</i> this guy, then?

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:34.670
I wait upon Chihaya-san hand and foot
due to certain circumstances.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:38.030
So you're like some sort of butler?

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:39.960
Close enough.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.050
If I had to say, I am Chihaya-san's...

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:46.090
...knight!

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:49.850
Anyway, you're also an "Ohtori-san"?

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:53.560
Oh, things could get confusing
if you had to call us both that.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:56.190
Why not go with Chihaya and Sakuya?

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:01.100
Chihaya-san would never allow
some lowlife to call her by name—

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:03.290
I don't mind, really.

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:04.900
I would expect no less of you.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.750
You are incredibly benevolent, 
even to lowlifes.

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:09.200
Then, Chihaya—

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.950
You're acting awfully chummy with her.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.450
Are you at the top of the leaderboards 
for world's rudest person?

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.730
You're like an open book.

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:20.210
Kotarou, classes are starting!

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:23.250
Why don't you hurry along? 
I'm going to catch a nap.

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:26.470
Act like you're going to class,
even if you're only pretending!

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:30.720
My dark magic can turn
an "absent" into a "present."

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:31.680
Of course.

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:34.160
The magic called authority, right?

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.730
Shall we, <i>Chihaya</i>?

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.770
Yeah. We'll be off!

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:42.980
Um, Tennouji Yotarou-kun, was it?

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:45.990
It's Kotarou, actually.

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:49.870
Personally, I hate you.

00:05:52.340 --> 00:05:54.170
<i>What the hell was with that butler guy?</i>

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:57.160
<i>And hey, does this mean
Chihaya's some high-class girl?</i>

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:00.020
<i>She sure doesn't look it.</i>

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:02.160
Okay, for this one... Konohana.

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:02.880
Yes.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:08.440
Say, why does the class rep
always wear gloves?

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:09.130
Shut up.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:10.390
What do I care?

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:12.100
But rumor says

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:15.020
she's a hypochondriac who doesn't like
touching things directly.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.030
Wait.

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:19.400
If she really were a hypochondriac,
I doubt she'd agree to be class rep.

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:21.530
You've got a point.

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:24.150
It doesn't seem like she avoids 
interacting with others.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:27.970
Maybe she has some other reason for it?

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.530
Huh? What would that be?

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:34.540
Maybe her gloves are seals to hide
 her secret cursed powers!

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.360
Wh-What's with that?

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:38.250
You've experienced it yourself, haven't you?

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.090
K-Knock it off.

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:40.460
Don't say any more!

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.420
I'm not like the others.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:45.000
I have secret cursed powers...

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:47.160
Stop it!

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:49.030
I-Inside of me...

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:50.930
Stop it, Tennouji!

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:53.930
The evil dragon awakens!

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:56.060
Quiet down, you two!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:01.560
Here we go, guys!

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:04.820
It's the reborn occult club's 
first group activity!

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:07.110
These cookies are delicious!

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:09.450
Chi, you've got too much in your mouth.

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:11.160
I'll take this one!

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:13.660
Would you like more tea?

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:15.270
I would.

00:07:15.270 --> 00:07:16.250
President.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.080
Ohtori-san's butler or not,
he's an outsider.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:21.170
Surely he can't be allowed to
freely enter the academy's premises?

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:22.510
It's fine.

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:26.800
My magic severs this club room 
from the academy's control.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.170
What sort of logic—

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:32.050
By the way, I have prepared this as well.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.100
Thank you.

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.030
You're way too easy, Class Rep!

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:40.290
Hey, why am I the only one left out
while you all have tea?!

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.350
A tsuchinoko?

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.170
Yeah.

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:47.810
The submission to the blog says a bunch of
people have spotted one on campus.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:49.590
Is it tasty?

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:50.990
You're planning to eat it?!

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:53.240
A tsuchinoko is just a fat snake.

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:54.870
Depressingly realist!

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:59.450
<i>It's not like I was particularly 
convinced that it was real, either.</i>

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:05.960
<i>But something tells me it wouldn't be
so strange if a tsuchinoko did exist.</i>

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:11.020
<i>And in the event I prove that 
paranormal phenomena exist...</i>

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:14.210
<i>I can have my way with those boobs!</i>

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:17.300
Kind sir, you have this
 wicked look in your eye.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:22.510
A-Anyway, I would like to make this 
the occult club's first investigation!

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.760
Here, tsuchinoko...

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:42.830
Ack!

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:44.710
That cry just now!

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:48.210
And this supreme texture,
both soft and perfectly firm.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.210
Could it really be a tsuchinoko?!

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:54.220
Can we talk this over?

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:58.510
Tennouji Kotarou!

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.850
Nasty, nasty, nasty!

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.360
Filthy, filthy, filthy!

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:07.340
You giant pervert!

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:08.800
Let's get out of here, Shizuru!

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:10.360
Farewell, Kotarou.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:11.730
Oh, found the tsuchinoko.

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:14.110
What? Capture it!

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.470
Damn! It just keeps moving!

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:20.370
Gotcha.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:21.840
Chi-chan is awesome.

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:23.120
That's our Chihaya!

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:25.580
Not a lot of brain, but a whole lot of brawn!

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:28.480
You're totally insulting me, aren't you?

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:35.050
You're not getting away!

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:42.520
No way.

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:44.150
You really caught it?

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:51.940
Um, you're not from this school, are you?

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:55.440
I am a UMA hunter.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:57.820
My name is Tsukuno.

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:00.680
You're a professional?

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:02.670
No, I actually work as a clerk.

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:05.330
I just <i>really</i> wanted
the bounty for the tsuchinoko.

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:09.180
Furthermore, the reward will cover my 
vacation abroad, a brand name purse,

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:12.900
designer clothes, and some new boots
from this winter's collection.

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:13.210
Kotarou-kun, this rumor was a total sham.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.960
Oh, I need to be getting back to work.

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:19.340
Well then, my like-minded 
friends, do excuse me.

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:23.930
Good work.

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:25.000
You did well.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:27.250
Looks like we achieved our goal.

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.950
Um, then...

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:32.020
<b>1st Occult Research Club Activities Report</b>

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:32.020
<b>Tsuchinoko Sighted on Campus!?</b>

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:32.020
<b>Complete</b>

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:35.080
Who'd have thought they'd 
have cutlet sandwiches left?

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:36.030
Lucky!

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:41.750
Shizuru's eating, too?

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:43.450
Come to think of it...

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:46.450
Let's eat lunch in the courtyard together.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:50.910
Shizuru.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:53.550
If you're about to have lunch,
do you want to eat with me?

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.590
We promised the other day, right?

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:58.630
Kotarou, you remembered?

00:10:58.630 --> 00:10:59.460
In that case...

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:02.700
Sorry to intrude.

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.050
Let's get right to it.

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:07.970
Time to eat!

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:12.600
What's that?

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:14.230
Broiled saury?

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.280
Unfortunately, I can't hand this over.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.370
Not even to you, Kotarou.

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:27.120
If you've been looking forward to it, 
then just eat it yourself.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.220
I'll help myself, then!

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:35.090
<i>She looks so happy,
I almost feel envious of the saury.</i>

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:37.260
What's up?

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:38.680
My eye is kind of itchy.

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:39.710
Hold up.

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:41.820
Should you really be
rubbing it directly like that?

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:43.280
That could make an infection worse.

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:44.600
It's not an infection.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:45.900
Why, then?

00:11:46.710 --> 00:11:48.060
You won't tell anyone?

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:51.560
If you don't want me to.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:55.060
I wouldn't mind showing you.

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:58.500
<i>Huh? Wait, this is weird.</i>

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:00.030
<i>Why do we have a nice mood going?</i>

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:09.720
Um...

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:11.330
Well...

00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:13.910
It's pretty.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.590
I think it's pretty.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:21.970
You're so cute, Shizuru.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.220
Sorry, sorry.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:31.730
Steel

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:31.730
Aluminum

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:30.410
Okay, I'm stuffed.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:31.730
Time to head back to the classroom.

00:12:32.490 --> 00:12:34.640
Tennouji Kotarou!

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:35.730
The class rep?

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:39.320
Can't you tell the difference 
between aluminum and steel?

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:42.150
Also, wash out the inside
before you throw it away!

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:48.770
W-Will this do?

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:51.330
Wait. It'll take up too much space 
if you throw it away as is.

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:52.920
Use this.

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:56.420
Wow, that's pretty cool!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.430
It uses the principle of leverage.

00:12:58.430 --> 00:13:00.100
It can crush steel cans, too.

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:01.800
You should try it out.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:03.080
Take that!

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:13.270
Aluminum

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:13.270
Steel

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:04.640
Oh, that feels great!

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:05.840
There's plenty more to go.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:08.160
All right, bring it on!

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:09.270
Take that!

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:11.040
And that!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.880
I feel used.

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:20.960
When you consider it payback for yesterday,

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.070
I'd say you got off lightly.

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:25.090
What are you doing, anyway, Class Rep?

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:27.450
Sorting for recycling purposes, of course.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.590
The Earth's resources are finite.

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:33.100
On an individual level 
they may seem unlimited,

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:34.930
but they will run out one day for sure.

00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:37.930
The accumulated, irresponsible 
waste of each individual

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.520
threatens to consume the Earth 
itself even in the present day.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:41.210
<i>Would a hypochondriac usually do this?</i>

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:45.720
<i>This is more like she's an
environmentally conscious clean freak.</i>

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:49.390
I'm essentially not just a representative 
of a tiny world known as a class,

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:51.490
but of the whole Earth—

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:53.590
Ahem.

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:54.450
Sorry.

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:56.750
I just said a bunch of embarrassing things,

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:57.730
so please forget them.

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.900
Nah. What's embarrassing about it?

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:03.500
We mustn't avert our eyes from
environmental issues, right,

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:04.600
Class Rep?

00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:06.650
No, Earth Rep!

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:09.520
I-I told you, stop that!

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:10.760
What're you saying?

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:14.490
What's so embarrassing about
the Earth Rep's pearls of wisdom?!

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:14.490
Stop it!

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:15.360
Don't say any more!

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:18.220
We've got to send this message 
to everyone in the world!

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:20.080
Oh, my esteemed Earth representative!

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:22.710
T-Tennouji...

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.420
Kotarou!

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:27.090
Why?!

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:31.600
The Earth Rep is fearsome.

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:36.470
I didn't think I'd be stuck in a bed 
in the infirmary until this late.

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:40.830
<i>I-It's her!</i>

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:46.010
<i>That's a massive dog!</i>

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:47.610
<i>It's chasing her?</i>

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:49.740
<i>Damn!</i>

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.690
<i>I'm honestly scared,</i>

00:14:55.690 --> 00:14:57.790
<i>but I'll be in trouble if she pops up again.</i>

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.500
<i>So I need to confirm a few things for myself.</i>

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.760
<i>Rewrite complete.</i>

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:30.900
Superpowers do exist. 
That's absolutely certain.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:32.840
How can you be so sure?

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:35.780
Do you have superpowers?

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:40.290
<i>You know, if I told her about this,
I could fondle her right away.</i>

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:43.790
<i>My rewritten physical abilities 
won't go back to normal.</i>

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:48.060
<i>Keeping this hidden is gonna be a pain.</i>

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:51.380
<i>I won't catch up unless
I kick it up another notch, huh?</i>

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:52.620
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:15:58.210 --> 00:16:00.520
<i>It's way too quiet here, even for night time.</i>

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:03.900
<i>Not to mention, I've felt
 this atmosphere before.</i>

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:10.790
I sensed that thing and tried to 
corner it here, but what's this?

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:14.660
I ended up catching a stray cat, too.

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:17.370
Since you're after that thing,

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.190
you're a hunter, I take it?

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:21.270
<i>Dangerous.</i>

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:23.790
<i>I don't know why,
but this guy seems dangerous!</i>

00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:26.120
Now that's a riot.

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:28.280
Are the hunters in
this peace-addled country

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:31.420
all this useless?

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:36.780
Time to feed.

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:38.050
Chow down!

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:46.150
Run, run!

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:35.400
S-Someone help!

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:47.750
<i>What was that thing called again?</i>

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:51.090
<i>That was no ordinary dog.</i>

00:17:57.670 --> 00:17:58.720
Based on the report—

00:17:58.720 --> 00:17:59.880
—ia diehards—

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:01.100
—took severe damage to his—

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:02.640
A monster, huh?

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:05.780
That's right.

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:06.990
That's a monster!

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:09.350
Oh, you all right, kid?

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.680
I see you're awake.

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:14.860
Um, why am I...

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:18.910
Oh, we found you passed out in the park,

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:21.470
so we decided to help.

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:22.760
Is that so?

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:23.780
In the park...

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:25.870
Th-Thank you very much.

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:28.710
So, what in the world happened?

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:31.000
You don't exactly look calm.

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:36.320
I was being chased by this weird dog...
Almost like a monster of sorts.

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:40.090
You were attacked by a monster?

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:40.820
Huh?

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:42.360
Where did it show up?

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:44.420
Don't worry. We'll slay it.

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:47.450
We're basically pros when it 
comes to taking down monsters.

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:49.790
U-Uh, slay it?

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:51.480
What's your affiliation?

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.110
A-Affiliation?

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:57.020
Um, the Kaza High
Occult Research Club, I guess?

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:58.720
I see.

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.740
Anyway, eat something.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:04.600
Uh, what did you mean by
"monster" and "slaying it"?

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.730
That was game talk.

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:07.250
Huh?

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:10.230
We're online game enthusiasts.

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:13.560
We often mix up games and reality.

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:16.240
<i>Ugh, they're old losers.</i>

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:21.470
But we've heard that a number of
unidentified animals exist in Kazamatsuri.

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:23.300
Maybe you saw one of them.

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:24.940
For real?!

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:27.310
Um, I'm actually looking for
 stories like that.

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:29.740
Could you tell me more?

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:32.310
Drop by my shop sometime, then.

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:33.720
Oh, pardon me.

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:35.370
I'm Esaka.

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:38.320
I run a small antiques shop in this city.

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:40.090
Esaka-san?

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:41.560
Yes, I will!

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:45.950
My intel will prove more useful in
practice than any strategy guide.

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:48.160
No, I'm not talking about a game.

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:49.840
Oh, you came, little lady?

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:51.460
Give me the usual, Gennady.

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:52.360
You got it!

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:57.980
Yo.

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:01.900
You know her?

00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:04.720
She's an underclassman from school
I'm somewhat close to.

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:06.720
Here. Thanks for waiting!

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:09.620
Shizuru, are you a regular here?

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:12.900
Gennady treats me to ramen all the time.

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:14.900
Are you a regular, too?

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:16.480
No, actually...

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:19.230
Maybe Lucia hit you too hard?

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:21.300
I'm starting to think so, too.

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:22.660
Wait, no!

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:24.910
Look, that thing nailed me!

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:30.040
You don't have any injuries.

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:30.840
Huh?

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:31.740
Wait, what?

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:32.720
You're right!

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:34.920
You must have been dreaming.

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:37.980
<i>Was it really a dream?</i>

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:42.170
<i>But my abilities have 
definitely been rewritten...</i>

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:43.510
I'm starved!

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.190
Gen-san, whip me up a meal!

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:47.340
Oh, the boss and 
the little lady are here, too?

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:49.070
Ah, it'll be crowded like this.

00:20:49.070 --> 00:20:50.820
All of you, put the tables out thataway!

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:52.930
Man, you're such a slave driver.

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:01.820
They're all regulars.

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:04.740
Oh, a fresh face.
You the little lady's boyfriend?

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:05.750
What was that?

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:09.190
I won't let any man have the 
little lady as long as I live!

00:21:09.190 --> 00:21:09.980
Huh?

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:11.450
No, Shizuru and I aren't—

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:32.290
She lives in that run-down 
apartment all by herself.

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:34.350
A working student, huh?

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:37.320
I wish there was something 
I could do to help her out.

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:41.260
So much has happened tonight that 
I can't make sense of it all.

00:21:41.260 --> 00:21:43.780
Oh? Imagine running into you here.

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.280
Out on a night stroll worrying 
about your scalp, Gobaldo-kun?

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:49.800
I-I'm not going bald!

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:52.040
And what're <i>you</i> doing out so late?

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:56.790
Chihaya-san wanted to eat some ice cream
that's only available in convenience stores.

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.740
You really are a butler, huh?

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:03.440
But don't you think
you're spoiling her a little too much?

00:22:03.780 --> 00:22:07.190
I'm her knight, Lowlife Sleazebag-kun.

00:22:08.080 --> 00:22:10.200
Did I do something to you?

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:12.060
You seem to be out to get me
for some reason.

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:17.560
The moment I saw you, I felt 
as though I had met my fate.

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:20.520
Yes, like we would eventually become enemies.

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:22.560
Huh? You're not making any sense.

00:22:22.560 --> 00:22:25.570
Oh, it is exactly as I said before.

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:29.650
I just hate you.
